*>   2003-12-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 194
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB SHPNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SHP0009.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> HAZARDOUS GOODS Y/N
    05 DANGER-GOODS-IND   PIC X.
    *> SERVICE S=STANDARD E=EXPRESS O=OVERNIGHT
    05 SERVICE-CD         PIC X.
    *> DELIVERY DISTANCE IN KM
    05 SHIP-DISTANCE      PIC 9(5).
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 SHIP-BLOCK         PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 SURCHARGE          PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM DANGEROUS-GOODS
    DISPLAY "SHIP-BLOCK=" SHIP-BLOCK
    DISPLAY "SURCHARGE=" SURCHARGE
    STOP RUN.
DANGEROUS-GOODS.
    IF DANGER-GOODS-IND = 'Y'
        EVALUATE TRUE
            WHEN SERVICE-CD = 'O'
                MOVE 'Y' TO SHIP-BLOCK
            *> LONG-DISTANCE HAZARDOUS SURCHARGE
            WHEN SHIP-DISTANCE > 800
                MOVE 75 TO SURCHARGE
            WHEN OTHER
                MOVE 30 TO SURCHARGE
        END-EVALUATE
    END-IF.
